{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"ayu-light-day","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Ayu Light Day","description":"A bright, airy light theme with orange accents.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"Ayu Light Day","path":"themes/ayu-light-day.json","uiTheme":"light"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/ayu-light-day.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"Ayu Light Day\",\n  \"type\": \"light\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#fafafa\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#5c6166\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#f3f4f5\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#eceeef\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#eceeef\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#f3f4f5\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#e7e8e9\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#d3e4f5\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#ffffff\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#f3f4f5\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#dfe1e3\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#ff9940\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#ff9940\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#ff9940\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#d3e4f5\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#e7e8e980\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#ff9940\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#dfe1e3\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#e65050\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#6cbf43\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#e6ba7e\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#f07171\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#abb0b6\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#86b300\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#a37acc\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#fa8d3e\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#399ee6\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#f2ae49\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#a37acc\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#5c6166\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#55b4d4\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#f2ae49\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#f07171\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Ayu Light Day\n\nA bright, airy light theme with orange accents.\n\nInstall it, then pick **Ayu Light Day** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a light theme.\n\nInspired by the Ayu Light palette (MIT).\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#fafafa` |\n| Text | `#5c6166` |\n| Accent | `#ff9940` |\n| Keywords | `#fa8d3e` |\n| Strings | `#86b300` |\n| Functions | `#f2ae49` |\n| Types | `#399ee6` |\n| Comments | `#abb0b6` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}